#
# QtDataVisualization: shadow shaders without GLSL array constructors (the OS X
# 10.6 port).
#
# Seven fragment shaders initialise their 16-entry Poisson disk with a global
# array constructor, vec2[16](...). OS X 10.6's GLSL compiler rejects array
# constructors ("constructor not supported for type array of 2-component
# vector of float"), the shader fails to compile, and ShaderHelper::initialize()
# stops the program with qFatal as soon as a graph with shadows is shown.
#
# The array is declared without an initialiser and filled element by element
# at the top of main(). The values and the shading are the same; every GLSL
# version this module targets on desktop accepts it.
#
# Apply: git apply, from the Qt source root
